.TH ZERODDS-PCAP 1 "May 2026" "ZeroDDS 1.0.0-rc.1" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
zerodds-pcap \- offline RTPS submessage decoder for pcap files
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B zerodds-pcap parse
.I FILE
.PP
.B zerodds-pcap stats
.I FILE
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B zerodds-pcap
parses a libpcap-format file, locates RTPS payloads (any L2 / L3 / L4
combination), runs the ZeroDDS RTPS-2.5 decoder, and prints the
submessages.
.PP
.B parse
prints every RTPS frame with its submessage list.
.B stats
prints aggregate counts per submessage kind.
.PP
.B zerodds-pcap
does NOT join a DDS domain or generate any traffic. It is a pure
offline tool.
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
Success.
.TP
.B 2
CLI parse error.
.TP
.B 3
File / pcap / RTPS decode error.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR zerodds-spy (1),
.BR tcpdump (1),
.BR wireshark (1)
